This project builds on torchvision (BSD 3-Clause licence) and on the COCO dataset:
the COCO annotations are licensed under CC BY 4.0, and the COCO images remain under
their own Flickr terms. Images and annotations are fetched at run time and are not
redistributed here. The pretrained torchvision weights are downloaded at run time
and checked against a pinned sha256 before they are loaded.
